# Tamagotchi Dashboard Widget

We have successfully overhauled the [CompanionMini](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/widgets/CompanionMini.tsx#27-267) dashboard widget into a Tamagotchi-inspired digital pet device! 

